{"song_id": 243099, "title": "Passe mon truc", "language": "fr", "lyricists": [], "lyrics": [{"section_id": "section_0", "type": "couplet1", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "- Heu salut, c'est toi le dj?", "rhyme": "adZ", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Ouais c'est bien ouais", "rhyme": "E", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Ouais alors je te laisse une cassette c'est la musique que je fais", "rhyme": "E", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Et si t'as le temps de la passer... 'fin bon, jte la laisse l\u00e0", "rhyme": "a", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Tiens j'te la met l\u00e0", "rhyme": "a", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}], "rhyme": "ABBCC", "rhyme_vowel": "ABBAA"}, {"section_id": "section_1", "type": "couplet2", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "- Hey hey hey ouais salut on c'etait vu talleur", "rhyme": "9R", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Et jt'avais laisser une tite cassette et ouais", "rhyme": "E", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Ah, ah tu la passe apr\u00e8s ce morceau l\u00e0, okay c'est cool", "rhyme": "ul", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}], "rhyme": "ABC", "rhyme_vowel": "ABC"}, {"section_id": "section_2", "type": "couplet3", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "- Ouais c'est encore moi", "rhyme": "a", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Tu m'avais dis que t'allais passer mon truc apres ce morceau", "rhyme": "o", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Euh en fait t'as oubli\u00e9 j'crois mais...", "rhyme": "E", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "3", "text": "D'accord... D'accord, juste apr\u00e8s Lenny Kravitz, okay", "rhyme": "E", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}], "rhyme": "ABCC", "rhyme_vowel": "ABCC"}, {"section_id": "section_3", "type": "couplet4", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "- Putain mais tu vas la passer ma cassette", "rhyme": "Et", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Et y a personne l\u00e0", "rhyme": "a", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Alors putain mais passe la merde !", "rhyme": "ERd", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "3", "text": "...Ouais, c'est \u00e7a, c'est \u00e7a", "rhyme": "a", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Et en plus Sunday Bloody Sunday tu l'as pass\u00e9 trois fois", "rhyme": "a", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "5", "text": "...Ouais c'est \u00e7a", "rhyme": "a", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "6", "text": "En fait tu fais genre le dj...", "rhyme": "adZ", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "7", "text": "Mais c'est genre t'aimes pas la musique", "rhyme": "ik", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "8", "text": "Et t'as aucun respect", "rhyme": "E", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}], "rhyme": "ABCBBBDEF", "rhyme_vowel": "ABABBBBCA"}, {"section_id": "section_4", "type": "couplet5", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "- Maintenant tu d\u00e9gage !", "rhyme": "aZ", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}, {"n": "1", "text": "J'vais la passer ma cassette", "rhyme": "Et", "persona": "pophip", "persona_id": "pophip"}], "rhyme": "AB", "rhyme_vowel": "AB"}], "album_id": 24248}